               "text": "#### The Result Is\n\nIn this game you will practice the link between addition and multiplication: multiplying is adding the same number many times.\n\nFor each calculation below, first try to find the result in your head. Then use the side arrows (▲ ▼) to reach the answer — each press of the upper arrow adds the repeated number. When you finish the three calculations, the complete times table of that number is revealed.",
